# Valley Floodcaller's ruling: the permission "applies to noncreature cards in any zone, provided something is allowing you
# to cast them. For example, you could cast a sorcery with flashback as though it had flash." Bot1 casts Faithless Looting
# from its hand in its own turn 1, then in Bot2's turn 2 casts it again from the graveyard for its flashback cost {2}{R}
# (CR 702.34a), and it is exiled as it resolves.

